body:
So I have a job that runs, and periodically fails with a mysterious "error_during_execution" result subtype.

```
    echo "$FULL_PROMPT" | npx @anthropic-ai/claude-code -p --verbose --output-format json --allowedTools "Bash(echo:*)" "Bash(find:*)" > "$TEMP_FILE"
```

the prompt is mostly the same between runs.  and more importantly, the output shows that all todos completed successfully.  i didn't include all of the output below, but every step worked.  it's only at the very end, after all todos are complete, that it bombs with an error_during_execution subtype for the result.  there's no other information to help troubleshoot what could be happening.

this is not consistent.  i can run it again with the same input, and it works fine.  and it's only about one out of every 10 runs that this error occurs.

i can't find a single instance of "error_during_execution" when i search for that string on google.  i'm reporting this because i'd really just like to know what i can do to debug this myself.  maybe i'm missing something will tell me why this sporadically fails?

